{% comment %}
  Product-specific Ingredients and Benefits supplied in the Vanaya Product
  Specifications dossier. Matching is title-based so every size of the same
  formula receives identical content, even when sizes are separate products.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign vanaya_product_name = product.title | downcase %}
{% assign is_seabuckthorn_kansa_ritual = false %}
{% if product.handle == 'vanaya-seabuckthorn-kansa-sculpt-ritual' %}
  {% assign is_seabuckthorn_kansa_ritual = true %}
{% endif %}

{% if is_seabuckthorn_kansa_ritual %}
  <details>
    <summary>Ingredients</summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <p><strong>What's inside:</strong> Vanaya Sea Buckthorn Oil (30 ml) and a dual-ended Kansa Wand (1 unit).</p>
      <p><strong>Sea Buckthorn Oil:</strong> Seabuckthorn-Grapeseed Oil (60%), Raspberry Seed Oil (20%), Seabuckthorn Oil (15%), Jojoba Oil (4%), Rosemary Essential Oil (0.5%), Carrot Seed Essential Oil (0.5%).</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="vp-product__hero-ingredient">
    <summary>Hero Ingredient <span>Sea Buckthorn Oil</span></summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <p><strong>Why it works:</strong> Sea Buckthorn is one of the few plant oils containing all four omega fatty acids (3, 6, 7 and 9). Omega-7 closely mirrors the skin's own lipids, helping support the moisture barrier. Its Vitamin C and Vitamin E content provides antioxidant support for elasticity and dullness.</p>
      <p><strong>The ritual pairing:</strong> The lightweight oil provides a smooth glide for the dual-ended Kansa Wand, helping you massage the natural contours of the face and neck without pulling the skin.</p>
      <p><strong>Best suited for:</strong> Dry, dull, dehydrated and mature-looking skin, or anyone seeking a calming facial massage ritual.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Benefits</summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <ul>
        <li>Deeply nourishes and helps support the skin's natural moisture barrier.</li>
        <li>Helps improve the appearance of elasticity and firmness with regular use.</li>
        <li>Revives dull, tired-looking skin for a naturally radiant appearance.</li>
        <li>Gentle Kansa massage helps reduce the appearance of temporary puffiness.</li>
        <li>Helps release facial tension around the jawline, forehead and brows.</li>
        <li>Creates a calming, sensorial self-care ritual for the face and neck.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>

