{% elsif vanaya_product_name contains 'kumkumadi tailam' %}
  <details>
    <summary>Ingredients</summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <p>Red Sandalwood, Manjistha, Yasthumadhu (Licorice), Daruhaldi, Ushira, Padmaka, Nilotpala, Pilkhan, Kamal Kesar, Cold Pressed Sesame Oil, Rose Water, Goat Milk, Khus, Laksha, Saffron (Kesar), Dashmool (a combination of ten herbs).</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="vp-product__hero-ingredient">
    <summary>Hero Ingredient <span>Saffron (Kesar)</span></summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <p><strong>Why it works:</strong> Saffron is the namesake and defining ingredient of Kumkumadi Tailam. Its active compound, crocin, helps inhibit the enzyme responsible for melanin overproduction, supporting a more even-looking skin tone. Its antioxidant activity also supports microcirculation and natural radiance.</p>
      <p><strong>Best suited for:</strong> All skin types, particularly dull, pigmented and prematurely ageing skin.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details>
    <summary>Benefits</summary>
    <div class="vp-product__detail-content">
      <ul>
        <li>Helps fade pigmentation, dark spots and uneven skin tone.</li>
        <li>Softens the look of fine lines and early signs of ageing.</li>
        <li>Gives skin a natural, lit-from-within radiance.</li>
        <li>Helps reduce the appearance of dark circles.</li>
        <li>Nourishes with time-tested Ayurvedic herbs for smoother texture.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>

